## Student GPU notes

| Queue | Role |
|-------|------|
| **`gpuv100`** | Primary (~50% of batch) |
| **`gpua100`** | Second (~20%); long cluster PEND when backlog huge |
| **`gpua10`, `gpua40`, `gpul40s`** | Spill (~10% each) |

Check: `bqueues | egrep 'gpuv100|gpua10|gpua40|gpua100|gpul40s'`

`#BSUB -n 4` + `#BSUB -gpu "num=1:mode=exclusive_process"` + `span[hosts=1]` for GPU jobs.
